Original Statement:
------------------
SELECT 
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_LAST_DOM,
  TPCDS.PROMOTION.P_ITEM_SK 
FROM 
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 
  INNER JOIN TPCDS.PROMOTION 
  ON TPCDS.PROMOTION.P_END_DATE_SK = TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DATE_SK 
WHERE 
  TPCDS.PROMOTION.P_PROMO_SK <= 296 AND 
  TPCDS.PROMOTION.P_RESPONSE_TARGET = 1


Optimized Statement:
-------------------
SELECT 
  Q1.D_LAST_DOM AS "D_LAST_DOM",
  Q2.P_ITEM_SK AS "P_ITEM_SK" 
FROM 
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 AS Q1,
  TPCDS.PROMOTION AS Q2 
WHERE 
  (Q2.P_END_DATE_SK = Q1.D_DATE_SK) AND 
  (Q2.P_RESPONSE_TARGET = 1) AND 
  (Q2.P_PROMO_SK <= 296)

Explain level:    Explain from section

